  7597ce29f5217344  "gCppuBsuB://0?maxdeliveryattempts=1" -- an attempt count
                    with no dead-letter topic. The parser accepted it, the
                    rendering dropped it (it was rendered only beside a
                    dead-letter topic), and the number named nothing either
                    way: there was no policy to put it in. Config.Validate
                    refuses it now, and every non-secret setting is rendered
